{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15062","headline":"长至日上公献寿 · 李竦","name":"长至日上公献寿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"候晓金门辟，乘时玉历长。\n羽仪瞻上宰，云物丽初阳。\n汉礼方传佩，尧年正捧觞。\n日行临观阙，帝锡洽珪璋。\n盛美超三代，洪休降百祥。\n自怜朝末坐，空此咏无[疆]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李竦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}